.TH OCSFS\-TOOL 8 "March 2026" "ocsfs 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
ocsfs\-tool \- inspect and manage OCSFS filesystems
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ocsfs\-tool
.I command
.I device
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ocsfs\-tool
is the administration CLI for OCSFS filesystems. It reads on-disk
metadata directly from the block device (no mount required).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B info
Display superblock information: UUID, label, version, geometry,
feature flags, creation time, mount count.
.TP
.B df
Display space usage: total, used, and free blocks per Allocation Group.
Shows per-AG ownership for multi-node environments.
.TP
.B check
Verify filesystem consistency: superblock CRC, AG headers, inode
table integrity, bitmap consistency.
.TP
.B nodes
List all node slots: slot ID, UUID, hostname, state (active/dead/free),
last heartbeat timestamp, PR key.
.TP
.B locks
Dump the lock table: active locks, holders, waiters, lock modes,
and CAS versions.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS 4
ocsfs\-tool info /dev/mapper/mpath\-3600508b...
.br
ocsfs\-tool df /tmp/test.img
.br
ocsfs\-tool check /dev/sda1
.br
ocsfs\-tool nodes /dev/mapper/mpath\-3600508b...
.br
ocsfs\-tool locks /dev/mapper/mpath\-3600508b...
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mkfs.ocsfs (8),
.BR mount.ocsfs (8),
.BR ocsfs\-defrag (8)
